<title>MEXICO: Mexico's crude ports shut due to winds - port.</title>
<headline>Mexico's crude ports shut due to winds - port.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's three main shipping ports were shut as of 1500 local/2100 GMT Monday, according to the communications and transport ministry and port captains.</p>
<p>Winds stronger than 50 miles per hour (80 kph) shut the terminals at Pajaritos in Veracruz state; Cayo Arcas in Campeche state and Dos Bocas in Tabasco state, port authorities said.</p>
